                                "example_id": "2ca6558e-adf3-4746-8622-25a958afaa7d",
                                "sense_id": "4d38cc61-0aeb-3ee3-bf46-ca946a79df19",
                                "text": "beachside property"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02b50909-84ef-42b5-afb2-7594747590ce",
                                "sense_id": "4d38cc61-0aeb-3ee3-bf46-ca946a79df19",
                                "text": "Very beachside. His mother always had a flair for interior design."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2832af31-88ee-439b-bfef-766da8a91f16",
                                "sense_id": "4d38cc61-0aeb-3ee3-bf46-ca946a79df19",
                                "text": "If you'd rather be beachside than poolside, scuba, surfing and fishing are all easily arranged from here."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7e0d267-9144-4506-9c17-61e0e1d7287e",
                                "sense_id": "4d38cc61-0aeb-3ee3-bf46-ca946a79df19",
                                "text": "Among its bungalows, the cheapest are simple wooden affairs well off the beach, while the priciest are beachside, a/c and cottage-like."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b218c892-8dad-40bb-a7ee-cb39ba332d37",
                                "sense_id": "4d38cc61-0aeb-3ee3-bf46-ca946a79df19",
                                "text": "Temperatures in the western suburbs of Sydney, far from the upmarket beachside glamour, reached 47C (117F) last week, topping the 44C I experienced there the week before. For reference, if it reached 47C in the middle of the Sahara desert, that would be an unusually hot day."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df839270-ee71-406f-a745-42b85ab046aa",
                                "sense_id": "4d38cc61-0aeb-3ee3-bf46-ca946a79df19",
                                "text": "The video – posted by Trump on his Truth Social account last week – depicts a family emerging from the wreckage of war-torn Gaza into a beachside resort town lined with skyscrapers."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
